  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Delivery of the International Citizen Service programme 2015 - 2018 is a component of International Citizens Service 2015-2021 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;127,112,868. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Democratic participation and civil society, Vocational training, Basic sanitation, STD control including HIV/AIDS, Basic life skills for adults, Primary education.</narrative>
  </description>
